A '''hyperlane''' ran from [[Junkfort Station]] east to the [[Oseon system]], linking the [[Centrality]]<ref name="TFABG" /> with the [[Triellus Trade Route]].<ref name="Triellus" />

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this hyperlane was known as the [[Cadma Conduit]] and was mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

